==Event Information==
The Battle Cats has finally surpassed 82 million downloads worldwide!!<br>
A limited-time campaign will be held to commemorate this!<br>
{{Color|#FF00CC|'''The event period is scheduled for May 22nd (11:00) to June 5th, 2023 (10:59)!'''}}

{{Color|#FF6600|'''●Get lots of XP! "Super Guerrilla XP Special" is held!'''}}<br>
During the campaign period, lots of guerrilla XP stages where you can get lots of XP appear!

